cuems-editor (0.1.0rc1-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release
  * WebSocket server for collaborative editing
  * Database management for projects and media
  * Integration with cuems-utils virtual environment
  * Systemd service for automatic startup
  * Package restructure: source in src/, tests in tests/
  * Dual-mode CLI: manual and daemon execution modes

